Discussion content is NOT covered by this file
----------------------------------------------

This repository hosts GitHub Discussions. Posts, comments, and any material
contributed to a discussion thread remain the property of their authors and are
governed by GitHub's Terms of Service, not by this license. Nothing here grants
KeMeK Network any rights over what you write beyond what those terms provide,
and nothing here licenses discussion content to third parties.

